      "value": "was thinking something kinda different, yet similar.\n\nbasically, a small compass on the opposite side of the screen to the talk button. it's a little ball that points toward either\n\nA: all users\nor (toggle)\nB: friends only\n\nafk users (users who've been idle for about 10 minutes) will appear to have a little keyboard with an \"X\" on it\n\nyou can also set an \"invisible\" status, that removes you from other's compass.\n\nother than that, the color of nametag is used for the arrow color.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
